<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="189" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">If the building official is satisfied that the proposed work conforms to the requirements of this code and laws and ordinances applicable thereto, the building official shall issue a permit therefor as soon as practicable.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
