<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="193" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The issuance or granting of a permit shall not be construed to be a permit for, or an approval of, any violation of any of the provisions of this code or of any other ordinance of the jurisdiction.</source>
