<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="193" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Permits presuming to give authority to violate or cancel the provisions of this code or other ordinances of the jurisdiction shall not be valid.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
