<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="195" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Every permit issued shall become invalid unless the work on the site authorized by such permit is commenced within 180 days after its issuance, or if the work authorized on the site by such permit is suspended or abandoned for a period of 180 days after the time the work is commenced.</source>
