<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="225" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where balconies or other elevated walking surfaces have weather-exposed surfaces, and the structural framing is protected by an impervious moisture barrier, the construction documents shall include details for all elements of the impervious moisture barrier system.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
