<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="259" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Permit valuations shall reflect the total value of work, including materials and labor, for which the permit is being issued, such as electrical, gas, mechanical, plumbing equipment and permanent systems.</source>
