<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="259" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">If, in the opinion of the building official, the valuation is underestimated on the application, the permit shall be denied, unless the applicant can show detailed estimates to meet the approval of the building official.</source>
