<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="263" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The payment of the fee for the construction, alteration, removal or demolition for work done in connection to or concurrently with the work authorized by a building permit shall not relieve the applicant or holder of the permit from the payment of other fees that are prescribed by law.</source>
