<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="293" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Inspections shall be made to determine compliance with Chapter 13 and shall include, but not be limited to, inspections for: envelope insulation R- and U-values, fenestration U-value, duct system R-value, and HVAC and water-heating equipment efficiency.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
