<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="295" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In addition to the inspections specified in Sections 110.3.1 through 110.3.9, the building official is authorized to make or require other inspections of any construction work to ascertain compliance with the provisions of this code and other laws that are enforced by the department of building safety.</source>
