<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="338" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">If not notified prior to disconnecting, the owner or the owner's authorized agent or occupant of the building, structure or service system shall be notified in writing, as soon as practical thereafter.</source>
