<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="352" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Residential Group R includes, among others, the use of a building or structure, or a portion thereof, for sleeping purposes when not classified as an Institutional Group I or when not regulated by the International Residential Code.</source>
