<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="352" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Group R occupancies not constructed in accordance with the International Residential Code as permitted by Sections 310.4.1 and 310.4.2 shall comply with Section 420.</source>
