<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="390" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Residential Group R-4 occupancy shall include buildings, structures or portions thereof for more than five but not more than 16 persons, excluding staff, who reside on a 24-hour basis in a supervised residential environment and receive custodial care.</source>
