<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="426" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">For buildings not greater than 420 feet (128 m) in building height, the fire-resistance rating of the building elements in Type IA construction shall be permitted to be reduced to the minimum fire-resistance ratings for the building elements in Type IB.</source>
