<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="428" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">2.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>In other than Group F-1, H-2, H-3, H-5, M and S-1 occupancies, the fire-resistance rating of the building elements in Type IB construction shall be permitted to be reduced to the fire-resistance ratings in Type IIA.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
