<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="429" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">3.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>The building height and building area limitations of a building containing building elements with reduced fire-resistance ratings shall be permitted to be the same as the building without such reductions.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
