<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="455" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Each connection and the supply piping between the connection and the pumps shall be sized to supply the flow and pressure required for the pumps to operate.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
