<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="456" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Two connections to the same main shall be permitted provided that the main is valved such that an interruption can be isolated so that the water supply will continue without interruption through not fewer than one of the connections.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
