<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="476" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">To facilitate smoke removal in post-fire salvage and overhaul operations, buildings and structures shall be equipped with natural or mechanical ventilation for removal of products of combustion in accordance with one of the following:</source>
