<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="486" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">If the standby or emergency power system includes a generator set inside a building, the system shall be located in a separate room enclosed with 2-hour fire barriers constructed in accordance with Section 707 or horizontal assemblies constructed in accordance with Section 711, or both.</source>
