<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="521" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Every required interior exit stairway serving floors more than 75 feet (22 860 mm) above the lowest level of fire department vehicle access shall be a smokeproof enclosure in accordance with Sections 909.20 and 1023.12.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
