<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="527" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In buildings with an occupied floor more than 120 feet (36 576 mm) above the lowest level of fire department vehicle access, not fewer than two fire service access elevators, or all elevators, whichever is less, shall be provided in accordance with Section 3007.</source>
