<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="541" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">That area of a building adjacent to or above the atrium need not be sprinklered provided that portion of the building is separated from the atrium portion by not less than 2-hour fire barriers constructed in accordance with Section 707 or horizontal assemblies constructed in accordance with Section 711, or both.</source>
