<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="563" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">A horizontal assembly is not required between the atrium and openings for exit access stairways and ramps complying with Item 4 of Section 1019.3.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
