<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="567" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The interior finish of walls and ceilings of the atrium shall be not less than Class B. Sprinkler protection shall not result in a reduction in class.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
