<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="574" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The distance between the entry to an exit stairway in an atrium and the entrance to a minimum of one exit stairway enclosed in accordance with Section 1023.2 shall comply with the separation required by Section 1007.1.1.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
